/arc-plc/texas/matagorda-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, October to November ran 40% of normal, and so far in 2026 May to June ran 189% of normal. Grid 10638 had its driest year in 1954 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
